1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,981
Dans un trou à travers

2
00:00:00,981 --> 00:00:01,790
la Terre,

3
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,428
tu deviendrais un yoyo humain.

4
00:00:03,448 --> 00:00:04,878
Sans air pour te freiner,

5
00:00:04,898 --> 00:00:06,448
tu tombes jusqu’au centre,

6
00:00:06,468 --> 00:00:07,688
tu remontes de l’autre côté,

7
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:08,912
et tu t’arrêtes pile à

8
00:00:08,912 --> 00:00:09,761
la surface.

9
00:00:09,781 --> 00:00:11,592
Environ trente-huit minutes.

10
00:00:11,612 --> 00:00:12,972
Si personne ne t’attrape,

11
00:00:12,992 --> 00:00:13,845
tu retombes.

12
00:00:13,865 --> 00:00:15,451
Aller, retour.

13
00:00:15,471 --> 00:00:16,489
Pour toujours.

14
00:00:16,509 --> 00:00:17,439
Sans air,

15
00:00:17,459 --> 00:00:18,540
rien ne t’arrête.

16
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,618
Et ça recommence :
